{"_type":"shard","campaign_names":["Empire City","Roanoke S4","Roanoke Season 4 / Empire City","Season 4, Empire City","roanoke-s4"],"channel":{"category":"The City (Manhattan)","id":"863311533328695367","name":"the-subway-pub","position":57,"server_id":"850779382791536640","topic":null,"type":"0"},"database_path":"discord/empire-city/empire-city.sqlite","database_sha256":"a0c71f99ff403e5a91d88c2dfb647326cbc332b4b943fa207cb080173a83f98e","project_ids":["roanoke-s4"],"server":{"harvested_at":"2026-10-02T13:43:57Z","id":"850779382791536640","name":"Empire City."},"server_slug":"empire-city"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"I offer to pour willow a drink. \"You'll have to find your own glass.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:10:41.200000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868616204242272316","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"You sure are a lively bunch, whats the occasion for celebration?\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:10:43.781000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-24T22:10:55.003000Z","id":"868616215067762688","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"I suppose we are living the musicians life!\" I say, looking at Jacob as though for approval.","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:11:16.102000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868616350631870534","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"None for me, thanks.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:11:31.328000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868616414494326815","reply_to_id":"868616204242272316","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"We are living life! What is the best way to survive a war? Whiskey and booze of course.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:11:40.079000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868616451198701578","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"Eh, screw it.\" Willow searches for a clean glass.","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:12:19.275000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868616615598641203","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"Not getting killed is my secret, Jacob.\" to Willow I say seriously: \"A priestess of Memory should have plenty of experience with alcohol.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:13:06.532000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868616813808848906","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"Right you are!\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:13:37.622000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868616944209768489","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"Regrettably, yes.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:14:14.212000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868617097679368202","reply_to_id":"868616813808848906","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"But if I die today, I'd rather it be drunk and full of cheer. Far better than bitter and alone, or full of pain or fear. No no. It is the bottles and cups for me.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:15:16.229000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868617357797502976","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"I look from one of them to the other. \"It is interesting my choice of drinking companions today. For normally I drink to forget, but today I am celebrating!\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:16:03.068000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868617554254528553","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"Your manner of speech feels so familiar, Jacob. You from around this area?\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:16:44.690000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868617728829820939","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"Right o. Thats the spirit my boy. Raise a toast with me: Here's to a long life and a merry one.\nA quick death and an easy one.\nA pretty girl and an honest one.\nA cold pint–and another one!\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:17:42.618000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868617971797458945","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"To long life!\" Willow raises her glass.","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:18:17.548000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868618118304530432","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"Twice as much for you, friends\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:18:30.073000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868618170838167603","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"He yells it out to the bar and signals the bar tender to give out shots to the rest of the bar.","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:18:34.281000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868618188487790643","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"How about it davy, my boy. Play us a jaunty tune.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:19:20.727000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868618383296430140","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
