{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"Buchanan ralleys the pub into a standing ovation.","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:23:34.178000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868619446347001926","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"I blush crimson. \"If only Mister Harkness could see me now!\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:24:02.393000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868619564689264710","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"This has been wonderful Davy. You are a manhattan treasure. People will speak of this day to their grandchildren.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:24:38.239000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868619715038310400","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"(The words 'MANHATTAN TREASURE' glow in electric purple neon in my brain)","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:26:04.558000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868620077086412890","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"Now that I have achieved my glow, and I am deep in my cups, I shall away to my bed, to enjoy myself (or some one else if they will let me)\" He sinks down into the shadows once again and departs.","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:26:48.150000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868620259924529202","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"What a delightful chap!\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:27:24.386000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868620411909316649","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"Truly. I feel like I've met him before, did he tell you his full name before I got here?\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:28:16.820000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-24T22:28:31.238000Z","id":"868620631833477120","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"(sorry, wasn't trying to)","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:30:14.080000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868621123657543701","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"Buchanan, he said. Jacob Buchanan.\" I rally the pub in a toast. \"TO JACOB BUCHANAN! HIP HIP!!!\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:30:40.735000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868621235456725002","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"What a fitting name! TO JACOB BUCHANAN!\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:31:16.498000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868621385457623040","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"Well, I have duties to fill... Eh, I can stay a little while longer, why not.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:32:11.973000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868621618136633374","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"So, Mister Davidson, what brings you here?\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:33:21.004000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868621907673616435","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"Thank you for sharing a drink with me, Willow. And please, simply call me Wintergreen. I am here in this pub to spend a bit of coin in celebration, for I expect to soon be gainfully employed, by a patron most powerful! Yes!\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:34:35.971000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868622222108000307","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"Oh really? Who?\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:35:03.049000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868622335681372210","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"Willow pays for another drink.","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:35:27.592000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868622438622191666","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
