{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"Well, I don't know the dynamics of the crew and she was upset.. But yeah she said something like \"now that they're  broken up he would want to get back with me\" thats weird right, he hasn't mentioned me has he?\" Vivica looks genuinely confused by the situation","created_at":"2021-07-25T05:41:14.689000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868729590913335316","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Srg. Waffles","id":"430898830498725888","is_bot":0,"username":"srg.waffles"},"author_id":"430898830498725888","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"Eliza brings her head back a little surprise \"She said that? I think the whole thing that was happening the night before and the day you arrived lead her to think a lot of things. I didn't know you two knew each other, but he also hasn't brought up past relationships very much either.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T05:44:41.383000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868730457850773524","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
