{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Srg. Waffles","id":"430898830498725888","is_bot":0,"username":"srg.waffles"},"author_id":"430898830498725888","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"Yeah, she's still sorting out her feeling, Finn was her first boyfriend after all. And it started out really good, but then I seemed to have messed some of that put...\" Eliza turns to Golden Orange","created_at":"2021-07-25T05:52:08.865000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868732334726320138","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"Oh?\" She leans over the table interested \"do tell\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T05:53:00.057000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868732549441151086","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Srg. Waffles","id":"430898830498725888","is_bot":0,"username":"srg.waffles"},"author_id":"430898830498725888","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"It's quite a lot, but interestingly enough, it all happened within one night. It was the night of a beauty pageant in Ferrytown and everyone was excited to go. Finn and Willow went together and Finn participated in...along with me but that's not too important right now...\" She starts really getting into the feeling she felt that night. \"I was having a hard day, nearly killed myself from the tax that day. FREAK ROSE BUSHES EVERYWHERE! and I was running late from practicing in the range so I rushed back to the ship and asked for Fuddles and Willows help. Fuddles ended up helping and she gave me this really beautiful dress. Juliet helped me make it fit and added some effect to it while I did the makeup.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T05:57:39.707000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868733722378272858","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Srg. Waffles","id":"430898830498725888","is_bot":0,"username":"srg.waffles"},"author_id":"430898830498725888","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"When I came out, I looked so beautiful and felt so powerful. It even brought out my Autumn side of things that has been hiding since we hung out! But like right now, I can't get rid of it.\"","created_at":"2021-07-25T05:59:12.166000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868734110179422328","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
